SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Thekla\, Agriolivado
LOCATION:Agriolivado\, Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The last panigiri of the Patmos summer: on the evening of 23 September boats cross from Agriolivado to the little chapel of Agia Thekla on the islet opposite for vespers\, treats\, and then food and song on the beach. Small and very local.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#agriolivado-panigiri-of-agia-thekla-agriolivado
